# Milestone: M3
# Covers: REPL session persists var bindings across separate chunks (lines);
#         each REPL frame is its own chunk but shares the implicit Realm.
#
# Activated: v0.10.7 W7 — Feature shipped (M8 / v0.9.x Strand C API).
# The REPL reuses the same Realm across input lines, preserving bindings.
# Old label: T20

var x = 41
x + 1
[00000000] 41
[00000000] 42
